  "label": "LGBTQ+ Discrimination Stereotype",
  "description": "This refers to the real-world societal stereotypes and prejudices that LGBTQ+ individuals often face, including being labeled as 'predators,' 'mentally ill,' or 'against nature.' The text 'gays on their way home after pride weekend' implicitly references the broader social context in which LGBTQ+ people may be subject to discrimination, even after celebratory events. The meme's positive intent contrasts with these external societal prejudices.",
